# Line endings are part of the catalog's identity.
#
# RK-07 hashes file CONTENT: the manifest carries a SHA-256 per pinned source and
# the loader enforces it on every build. An end-of-line translation on checkout
# would change every digest, and a Windows clone would fail its own integrity gate
# with no code having changed. So conversion is switched off, not merely defaulted.

* text=auto eol=lf

# The pinned snapshot is byte-exact GitHub truth. Git must never touch it.
catalog/sources/**            -text

# Generated artifacts are compared byte for byte by `catalog emit --check`.
catalog/sources.manifest.json -text
catalog/catalog.snapshot.json -text
catalog/rejection-report.json -text
